\p
\v 4 \add This letter is from\add* Yohan¦155395 to¦155396 the¦155396 seven¦155421 assemblies¦155398 in¦155400 Asia¦155402 \add Minor\add*:\x + \xo 1:4: a \xt Exo 3:14; \xo b \xt Rev 4:5.\x*
\p Grace¦155403 and peace¦155406 to you¦155404 all¦155404 from the \add God\add* who is and was¦155414 and will¦155424 be, and from the seven spirits¦155422 who are¦155424 in front¦155426 of¦155429 his¦155429 throne¦155428,
\v 5 and from¦155431 \nd Yeshua¦155432\nd* \add the\add* \nd messiah¦155433\nd*, the¦155436 faithful¦155437 witness¦155435, the¦155438 first¦155439 to come back to life, and the¦155444 ruler¦155445 of all the leaders \add of the nations\add* of the world.\x + \xo 1:5: a \xt Isa 55:4; \xo b \xt Psa 89:27.\x*
\p \add Yeshua\add* loves¦155452 us and¦155430 he has¦155456 released¦155456 us from our¦155463 sins¦155462 by his¦155467 blood¦155466,
\v 6 and made¦155469 us¦155470 into a kingdom¦155473 of priests¦155476 to¦155484 \nd God¦155479\nd* his¦155483 father¦155482, and he is deserving of honour and power throughout the¦155495 ages¦155497. May¦155501 it¦155501 be¦155501 so¦155501.\x + \xo 1:6: \xt Exo 19:6; Rev 5:10.\x*
\p
\v 7 Look¦155502, he's¦155503 going to come¦155503 \add back\add* in the¦155506 clouds¦155507, and everyone¦155513 will see¦155509 him—the one who¦155516 they¦155518 speared—and all¦155523 the¦155524 tribes¦155525 on the¦155526 earth¦155527 will be¦155520 mourning¦155520 over¦155521 him. REWORK OT QUOTES\x + \xo 1:7: a \xt Dan 7:13; Mat 24:30; Mrk 13:26; Luk 21:27; 1Th 4:17; \xo b \xt Zech 12:10; Yhn 19:34,37; \xo c \xt Zech 12:10; Mat 24:30.\x*
\p
\v 8 “I am¦155531 the A and the Z,” says¦155542 \nd Yahweh¦155544 God¦155546\nd*, the one who¦155550 is¦155542 and was¦155551 and will be—the most powerful one.\x + \xo 1:8: a \xt Rev 22:13; \xo b \xt Exo 3:14.\x*
\s1 Yohan sees the messiah
\rem /s1 Vision of the Son of Man; A Vision of Christ; One like a Son of Man
\p
\v 9 I, Yohan¦155558, am your¦155562 brother¦155561 and partner in¦155566 the¦155567 suffering \add that's typical of those who follow\add* Yeshua. \add I've been exiled to\add* Patmos¦155588 Island¦155585 where I endure¦155574 because¦155589 I believe \nd God's¦155594\nd* message¦155592 and \nd Yeshua's¦155577\nd* testimony¦155598 and \add look forward to\add* his kingdom¦155572.
\v 10 One Sunday \add while I was meditating\add*, \add God's\add* \nd spirit¦155604\nd* gave me a vision, and¦155609 I heard¦155610 a voice¦155614 behind¦155612 me that seemed as loud¦155615 as a trumpet¦155619 blast
\v 11 that said¦155620, “Write¦155637 down what¦155634 you¦155635 see¦155635 \add here\add* on a scroll¦155640 and send¦155642 it to the¦155643 seven¦155644 assemblies¦155645 \add of believers\add*—to \add the cities of\add* Ephesus¦155650, Smyrna¦155653, Pergamum¦155656, Thyatira¦155659, Sardis¦155666, Philadelphia¦155669, and to Laodicea¦155672.”
\p
\v 12 Then¦155673 I turned¦155675 to see who was¦155680 talking¦155680 to me¦155684, and¦155673 I saw¦155687 seven¦155688 golden¦155690 lamp holders,
\v 13 and¦155691 standing among them was a man¦155702 who looked like the¦155704 son¦155700 of¦155702 humanity,\f + \fr 1:13 \ft It's not certain what was meant here: either ‘a man who looked like the son of humanity’ or ‘a form that looked like a human man’.\f* wearing a long robe with a golden¦155711 sash around His¦155702 chest.\x + \xo 1:13: a \xt Dan 7:13; \xo b \xt Dan 10:5.\x*
\v 14 His¦155716 hair¦155719 was gleaming white¦155720 like wool¦155723 or snow¦155726 and¦155714 his¦155716 eyes¦155729 were¦155719 \add bright\add* like a fiery flame¦155732.\x + \xo 1:14: \xt Dan 7:9.\x*
\v 15 His¦155737 feet¦155736 shone like bronze¦155739 that had¦155743 been¦155743 refined¦155743 in¦155741 a furnace¦155742, and¦155746 his¦155737 voice¦155748 was like the¦155751 sound of a \add river of rushing\add* water¦155752.\x + \xo 1:15: \xt Eze 1:24; 43:2.\x*
\v 16 He was holding¦155755 seven¦155764 stars¦155763 in¦155757 his right¦155759 hand¦155761 and a¦155770 sharp¦155772 sword¦155770 was extending from his mouth¦155768, and his face¦155776 was like¦155779 the¦155780 sun¦155781 shining¦155782 at its¦155786 brightest.
\v 17 And¦155787 when¦155788 I saw¦155789 him¦155790, I quickly lay at¦155793 his feet¦155795, \add breathless\add* like a dead¦155799 man, but¦155787 he¦155801 placed his right¦155804 hand¦155804 on¦155807 me, and told¦155809 me, “Don't be¦155812 afraid¦155812. \em I am\em* the¦155815 first¦155817 and the last.\x + \xo 1:17: \xt Isa 44:6; 48:12; Rev 2:8; 22:13.\x*
\v 18 I lived¦155823 and died¦155826 \add here on the earth\add*, but¦155821 look, \add now\add* I'm¦155830 alive \add again\add* and will live for all eternity, and I control the¦155839 keys¦155840 over death¦155842 and over hell.
\v 19 So¦155849 record what you're seeing¦155851 \add now\add* as well as \add what I'll show you\add* about current and¦155852 future events.
\v 20 This is the meaning of the seven stars that¦155870 you¦155871 saw¦155871 in my¦155878 right¦155876 hand¦155876 and of the seven golden¦155884 lamp holders:\x + \xo 1:20: \xt 1:12.\x* The¦155883 seven stars represent \add God's\add* messengers¦155888 \add watching over\add* those seven groups of believers,\x + \xo 1:20: \xt 1:11.\x* and the seven lamp holders represent those groups of believers.
\c 2
\s1 The message to the assembly in Ephesus
