\v 17 Everyone¦156363 who wants¦156330 to understand¦156330 needs¦156332 to listen¦156332 to what¦156333 \add God's\add* \nd spirit¦156335\nd* is¦156336 saying¦156336 to the¦156368 assemblies¦156338.
\p Anyone¦156363 who \add stays true\add* will¦156341 be¦156341 given hidden¦156349 food from heaven, and¦156355 I'll¦156341 give \add each of\add* them a white¦156354 stone¦156353 with a new¦156360 name¦156359 written¦156361 on¦156356 it that¦156348 no¦156363 one¦156363 knows¦156364 apart from the person receiving¦156369 it.”\x + \xo 2:17: a \xt Exo 16:14-15; 16:33-34; Yhn 6:48-50; \xo b \xt Isa 62:2; 65:15.\x*
\s1 The message to the assembly in Thyatira
