\p
\v 18 To¦156371 the¦156371 assembly's¦156377 messenger¦156372 in¦156375 Thyatira¦156376 write¦156378:
\p \nd God's¦156384\nd* son¦156382, the one with eyes¦156388 like a flame¦156391 of¦156393 fire¦156393 and¦156394 with feet¦156396 like bronze¦156399, says¦156380:
\v 19 “I know¦156400 what you've been doing, and \add about\add* your love¦156406 and faith¦156409, and your service¦156413 and endurance¦156417, and what you're doing now is better than¦156426 what you first¦156428 did.
\v 20 But¦156453 I have¦156430 against¦156431 you that you tolerate that woman¦156439 Jezebel¦156442 who calls¦156446 herself¦156448 a prophetess¦156451, and she¦156454 deceives my¦156460 servants¦156461 by teaching¦156454 them to be sexually¦156462 immoral¦156462 and to eat¦156464 \add food that's been\add* offered to idols¦156465.\x + \xo 2:20: \xt 1Ki 16:31; 2Ki 9:22,30.\x*
\v 21 Even though I've given¦156468 her time¦156470 to repent¦156472, she's¦156476 \add still\add* not¦156474 willing to turn away from her immorality¦156480.
\v 22 Listen, I'm¦156488 going to \add punish her with a terrible sickness\add*, and¦156494 to punish those who are committing¦156496 adultery¦156496 with her with terrible suffering if¦156502 they¦156505 don't¦156503 turn away from what she's doing.
\v 23 I will kill¦156515 her¦156514 children¦156513, then¦156511 all¦156520 the¦156521 assemblies¦156522 will know¦156519 that¦156523 I am¦156525 the one who searches¦156527 \add people's\add* affections and hearts¦156530, and who \add punishes or rewards\add* each¦156534 one of¦156538 you¦156538 depending on your¦156538 actions.\x + \xo 2:23: a \xt Psa 7:9; Jer 17:10; \xo b \xt Psa 62:12.\x*
\p
\v 24 But¦156540 the¦156543 rest¦156545 of you \add believers in the city\add* of Thyatira¦156548 haven't obeyed that woman's teachings¦156553 and haven't taken part in what she calls ‘the secret practices that Satan¦156563 taught¦156553 her’, I have¦156551 something to say to you¦156539 all¦156539 as¦156564 well. I won't¦156550 give you any other other burden¦156572
\v 25 except just to continue to obey the true teaching that¦156579 you've received, until¦156578 I return.
\v 26 And¦156585 anyone who's victorious, who continues to do what I command until¦156588 the end¦156589, I'll¦156593 give¦156593 them authority¦156595 to rule over¦156596 the people groups on earth.\x + \xo 2:26-27: \xt Psa 2:8-9 (LXX).\x*
\v 27 They'll rule them¦156601 with¦156602 irresistible power, and¦156599 \add those who rebel\add* will¦156600 be¦156600 smashed like \add unwanted\add* clay pots,
\v 28 just like \add the authority\add* that I've¦156614 received¦156615 from¦156616 my¦156619 father¦156618. And¦156620 I'll¦156621 give¦156621 them the¦156625 morning¦156626 star¦156624.
\p
\v 29 Everyone who wants¦156628 to understand¦156628 needs¦156630 to listen¦156630 to what¦156631 \add God's\add* \nd spirit¦156633\nd* is¦156634 saying¦156634 to the¦156635 assemblies¦156636.”
