\v 6 Everyone who wants¦156791 to understand¦156791 needs¦156793 to listen¦156793 to what¦156794 \add God's\add* \nd spirit¦156796\nd* is¦156797 saying¦156797 to the¦156798 assemblies¦156799.”
\s1 The message to the assembly in Filadelfia
