\v 7 To¦156801 the¦156812 assembly's¦156807 messenger¦156802 in¦156804 Filadelfia¦156805 write¦156809:\x + \xo 3:7: \xt Isa 22:22; Yob 12:14.\x*
\p The¦156814 holy¦156813 one, the true¦156815 one, the one having¦156819 \add King\add* David's¦156823 key¦156821 \add to the city\add*, the one who opens \add doors\add* no one can shut, and¦156800 who shuts \add doors\add* no one can open, says¦156811:
\v 8 “I know \add everything\add* you've been¦156855 doing. Listen¦156850, I have¦156845 placed an opened¦156855 door¦156854 in front¦156852 of¦156846 you that¦156856 no¦156858 one¦156858 can shut¦156862. You¦156866 aren't¦156874 very strong, yet¦156868 you've obeyed my¦156870 instructions and¦156873 you haven't disowned¦156875 knowing¦156845 me¦156878.
\v 9 Listen¦156879, I'll give¦156882 those¦156882 \add people\add* from Satan's¦156887 synagogue¦156885 (the¦156884 ones who say¦156889 that they're \add believing\add* Jews¦156891, but¦156893 they're not—they're lying¦156897), I'll make¦156899 them¦156900 so that they will¦156903 come¦156903 and bow down in front¦156907 of¦156910 you, and \add then\add* they'll¦156903 know¦156912 that I love¦156916 you.\x + \xo 3:9: a \xt Isa 49:23; 60:14; \xo b \xt Isa 43:4.\x*
